    generate availibility  card for liver avilailbity mention One man and Vailable today show the timing block random green and booked hr mostly keep the Business hr available show current date and time mention Same day availibity found , make minimilistic for mobile , only show availiblity today available  make timeing and mark very small green Lines try to compact this A Lot 
